elon is part of a select group of people  who can genuinely say that their  endeavors have significantly impacted  modern human life he has already changed  the automobile market with tesla he  plans to colonize mars with spacex and  he is on his way to cover the entire  earth with satellite internet using  starlink but now it seems like he is  also trying to disrupt the smartphone  market with tesla's new phone model pi  stick around as i discussed the  repercussion of elon and tesla entering  the smartphone market and the features  this new phone might have tesla model pi  features the rumors about the tesla  model pi started picking up steam after  the youtube channel adr studio uploaded  a video titled tesla model p concept in  february 2021. since then many netizens  have floated many theories about the  phone and try to imagine what it might  feature adr's video no doubt gave a very  slick look to the phone and showed us a  lot of its design language but it only  revealed a few basic features so let us  use that video as a guiding principle  and imagine all the features the tesla  model pi might pack construction  first of all the construction coming  from the tesla stables it is easy to  imagine that the model pi would be  constructed out of a high-grade aluminum  casing in fact adr's video indicates  that the phone's construction is strong  enough to withstand 150 megapascals of  force equivalent to 1500 times the  atmospheric pressure on the surface of  the earth this hints that the foam will  be constructed and designed to operate  under such extreme conditions now i'm  not saying that this means the model pi  can be used in space or on the surface  of mars but you can make of this feature  what you will because ordinary  smartphones are not usually constructed  to have such strong frames it will be  pointless for them to use a case so  unless elon and tesla have some specific  use case in mind for the model pi i  don't know what they would need to make  a phone that strong solar recharging  moving on to the back of the phone adr  studio imagines that the back case of  the tesla model pi will have solar  charging capacity i feel having a high  efficiency solar panel attached to the  back of a smartphone could be  game-changing not only will it make the  phone totally sustainable but it also  fits perfectly with tesla's value  proposition as an environmentally  friendly company plus a phone that can  automatically charge itself and become  totally free of external charging would  be a godsend for the modern smartphone  user portable solar panels have been  around for ages but they are usually  clunky and not very efficient this is  because most solar panels are made of  silicon and their density and surface  area define their efficiency  unfortunately converting silicon into a  dense photovoltaic solar cell capable of  converting light energy into electrical  energy and packing enough cells together  in a large enough surface area is a very  costly and ineffective process that's  why small chinese solar panels you can  buy from amazon generate a minimal  amount of power and they even need a lot  of time to do that suppose tesla has  somehow managed to crack the efficiency  problem with solar panels which i know  that they are currently working on in  that case there is no reason to doubt  that the model pi will ship with an  integrated solar panel on its back case  capable of charging its undoubtedly  colossal battery battery technology  speaking of battery size many people  have theorized that the model pi will  feature a massive 7100 milliamp hour  battery which is almost twice the  battery size of the iphone 13 pro model  suppose tesla was indeed planning to use  a solar panel to charge this massive  battery in that case it definitely needs  to make the battery more efficient than  all smartphones existing lithium-ion  batteries and what do you know they are  already working hard to create the next  generation of batteries for their  automobiles so they can easily  miniaturize that for a smartphone  tesla's new 4680 battery cell with a 46  millimeter diameter and 80 millimeter  length holds about five times the energy  of its current smaller 2170 cells and is  also easier to charge these lithium-ion  phosphate or lfp battery cells can be  used for the model pi with a few  modifications but the question needs to  be asked why does the model pie need  such a massive battery well this is  where the next few features of the phone  come in the cameras connectivity module  and the artificial intelligence aspect  of the model pi i could dedicate  different videos to each of these  features still for this video let's take  a quick look at how they make the model  pi so different from other phones  cameras and ai in adr's video the model  pi looks strikingly similar to the  iphone 12 pro max with a few key  differences first of all the camera  module is entirely different it houses  four cameras arranged in a square  similar to the galaxy s20 ultra although  a four camera setup is nothing new these  four cameras are a bit special first  they are tuned to excel at highly dark  astrophotography allowing users to  capture the night sky like never before  but more importantly the model pi's four  cameras are not just cameras they are  like an all-seeing eye designed to work  in conjunction with tesla's massive ai  neural net this is a neural net that  tesla is currently training for its  recently released fsd beta program it  will eventually take over the entire  tesla fleet a concept i have discussed  in great depth in my tesla's robo taxis  video anyways you might be wondering how  the model pi's camera system helps the  tesla ai well just like the tesla cars  have cameras and sensors to allow them  to see their environment think of these  four cameras as an extra set of eyes for  the ai so it will now use what the tesla  pi user sees through their camera which  these days is just about everything we  interact with in our daily lives and  it'll use that extra source of  information to perform various functions  around it for starters this will also  allow the model pi to be better  integrated with all tesla car models  allowing users to have more controls  through the tap of a button maybe users  can control features such as locking  unlocking temperature multimedia  navigation and even an ai show first  service which tesla has already claimed  to be working on with their robo taxi  announcement future smartphone users may  only need to sync their card to their  tesla phone and let the ai take care of  the rest this ai may also act as your  personal assistant based on your regular  interactions make suggestions optimize  your workflows automatically set  appointments for you recommend reading  and viewing materials based on your  preferences and give you health  recommendations and warnings based on  your eating and lifestyle habits i mean  the possibilities are really limitless  we are steadily moving closer to a world  depicted in the movie her where a  portable ai becomes people's everyday  companions now having a smartphone that  can do all that would be something  connectivity the next significant  feature that will be integral to making  all this possible and the ai viable for  the user of the model pi is connectivity  the model pi would be able to  communicate with the starlink network  when fully operational it would mean  that if you own a tesla model p you'll  have access to the internet anywhere on  this planet more than anything else i'm  really excited about this feature now  wouldn't that be nice for a phone that  can access information anywhere on the  planet without any connectivity hassle  gone will be the days of having to point  our smartphones to the skies to get that  extra bar of connection in areas with  spotty coverage now i can enjoy  high-speed internet everywhere of course  this feature will entirely depend on the  success of the starlink network still  with spacex already sending 2 300  satellites into orbit and launching a  successful beta program i am confident  about their goal of covering the entire  earth with wireless internet by 2030. is  the tesla phone real  there are various reasons why tesla  would like to enter the smartphone  market still i think that if elon were  to commit to this project it wouldn't be  unless it's a genuine generation  defining product like the iphone was 15  years ago anything short of that and the  model pi would just be another name in a  long list of smartphones released yearly  and elon definitely doesn't want that  the technologies required to develop a  phone with all the features described in  this video are just not there and even  though tesla is one of the most  cutting-edge companies they still don't  possess the technologies required to  deliver a product like the model pi  that's why the tesla model p is nothing  but a concept sadly there is no truth to  this rumor sorry to burst your bubble if  you thought we might get a tesla phone  soon but neither elon nor tesla have  ever hinted at a smartphone or that  there is indeed a project underway to  design such a phone however as a tech  junkie it is always fun to speculate and  suppose tesla is indeed secretly working  on a model pi smartphone concept and  announces it to the public at large in  that case i'd be the first person to  swallow my pride and welcome it with  open arms but until then there is no  reason to believe otherwise so what do  you think are elon and tesla working on  a smartphone project and if so what  features would you like to see in the  new phone let me know down in the  comment section below if you've enjoyed  this video subscribe to the channel and  give me a thumbs up i'll see you in the  next one
 

